Hi everyone!


We received several bug reports after releasing the new demo that were making progress difficult, so we decided to roll out one more small update.

[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45023929/229fedd5ead0bf3cd188f1db11337928c2e9e467.jpg"]The most significant improvement was polishing the scene with the three Tonyas, we greatly enhanced the animations and added sound effects, making the scene even hotter!


We also fixed several critical bugs that were blocking progress for some players, along with a bunch of annoying little quirks.


Wishing you all a fantastic mood and stay tuned so you don’t miss anything exciting!


